    "title": "Panthers Hold Ferris State to 1-1 Draw - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago CALEDONIA, Mich. — Davenport took an early lead against Ferris State on Friday afternoon and held on for a 1-1 draw after a scoreless second half. Davenport took an early 1-0 lead in the 28th minute when Audrey Muterspaugh scored off an assist from Sofia Capoccia. Capoccia created an early chance for the Panthers, recording two shots in the opening eight minutes, including one that was saved by Ferris State goalkeeper Korinne Ihrke. Read full article",
